      "message": "This \"works\" but it even breaks downloads in Chromium.\n\nOne thought could be for apps to have their own primary directories with files ending up in e.g. /sdcard/Download/$packageName or /sdcard/Android/media/$packageName/Download. For Downloads, this could still possibly mean that all downloaded files show up in Downloads, but just not in floating in /sdcard/Download. Maybe apps would have virtualized views that correspond to their package names.\n\nThis could be quite an undesirable user experience. I don\u0027t prefer it at all. Maybe there is something else that can be done.",
